 "The sum of the squares of the coefficient is the multiplier of the variance \
of ",
 StyleBox["y",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9430949226186905`*^9, 
  3.9430949520549192`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"eeb209b6-c685-4083-8378-\
5830c0730a54"],

